  "progresion": "Think in terms of the rep range, not the weight on the bar. Add reps first; once you're maxing out every set for an exercise, then add a little weight and drop back to the bottom of the range. Sticking with the same routine week after week — not switching it up — is what makes the numbers move.",
  "mensaje_para_el_cliente": "Hi Marta, here's your first draft routine. Let's go step by step: technique first, weight later — you learn the movement before you load it. It doesn't need to be perfect the first week; what matters is that you can repeat it. If you have any questions, or if something hurts (not just feels tough), let me know and we'll adjust it."
